name: Matador
author: genie (for pi)
description: >
  the wish: Matador — earn $8 whenever your played hand triggers the Boss Blind's
  ability. an economy engine that turns the scariest blinds into a payday. find it
  early so the money compounds.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: Matador
    antes:
      - 1
      - 2
      - 3
should:
  - joker: Matador
    antes:
      - 1
      - 2
      - 3
      - 4
    score: 30
  - uncommonJoker: Showman
    score: 15
    max: 1
